# Pull's targets are "up to two" (CR 601.2c): Bot1 chooses Hill Giant and declines the second, so only the Hill Giant enters (with haste, CR 702.10) and is sacrificed at the end step, while
# the Ornithopter that was also discarded by Chain of Smog stays in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Push // Pull
Hill Giant
Ornithopter
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Chain of Smog
Island x18

